Chart PNG rendering embeds `resource/font/santaizi-cjk.ttf`. The file currently
shipped is Go Regular from `golang.org/x/image/font/gofont` (Copyright The Go
Authors, BSD-3-Clause). Replacing it with a Noto Sans SC subset enables CJK
glyphs in chart labels; Noto fonts are licensed under the SIL Open Font
License 1.1 (https://scripts.sil.org/OFL).

Optional probe routing on collector hosts may exec an independently
installed nexttrace binary (https://github.com/nxtrace/NTrace-core),
licensed under GNU GPL-3.0. Santaizi does not link NTrace-core, does
not vendor it into Docker/GHCR images, and does not require it to run
ping or MTR. Source: https://github.com/nxtrace/NTrace-core

